  "q": "What does \u201cmeat hit\u201d mean in regard to ammunition types? Specifically, Biotoxin (page 345), Poison (page 346), and Sleep (page 346).",
  "a": "Here we use the term Meat to refer to entities that are not entirely inorganic. Entities like drones or full borgs are not considered Meat. When we use the term Meat followed by a specific body part (such as when we say meat eyes with teargas ammunition), the rule is checking if that particular body part is cybernetic or not."
